<view class="head"><view class="eyebrow">STORE APPOINTMENT</view><view class="title">预约到店服务</view><view class="subtitle">提交后由门店确认具体安排</view></view>
<view class="container content"><view class="card"><view class="section-title">选择服务</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{serviceTypes}}" value="{{serviceIndex}}" bindchange="onService"><view class="field">{{serviceNames[serviceTypes[serviceIndex]]}}<text>›</text></view></picker><view class="section-title">预约时间</view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="{{minDate}}" bindchange="onDate"><view class="field">{{date}}<text>›</text></view></picker><picker mode="selector" range="{{timeSlots}}" value="{{timeIndex}}" bindchange="onTime"><view class="field">{{timeSlots[timeIndex]}}<text>›</text></view></picker><view class="section-title">服务车辆</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{vehicles}}" range-key="plateNumber" value="{{vehicleIndex}}" bindchange="onVehicle" wx:if="{{vehicles.length}}"><view class="field">{{vehicles[vehicleIndex].plateNumber}}<text>›</text></view></picker><view class="hint" wx:else>暂未添加车辆，门店可在到店后为您建档。</view><view class="section-title">备注（选填）</view><textarea value="{{remark}}" maxlength="200" placeholder="如：希望周末上午完成" bindinput="onRemark" /><button class="button-primary submit" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">提交预约</button></view><view class="section-title history-title">我的预约</view><view class="card history" wx:for="{{appointments}}" wx:key="_id"><view><view class="history-main">{{item.appointmentDate}} {{item.timeSlot}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.serviceText}} · {{item.vehicleSnapshot.plateNumber || "到店确认车辆"}}</view></view><view class="status">{{item.statusText}}</view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!appointments.length}}">还没有预约记录</view></view>
